Node ID=1001 Lucius Exposed
Text=Yes, small one, I knew the bodies that surrounded these hearts, and they knew me. These cold hearts belonged to the other elders of my tribe, the ones who forced me to run for my life. But, all's well that ends well, I suppose.  Thank you, and please accept this reward as well as my sincerest gratitude. 
